## Third-party code

This project contains code derived from Wordgard (https://wordgard.net/).

Affected files:

  - src/doc/           (the entire directory)
  - src/extensions/functionality/undo-redo.ts
  - src/extensions/node/paragraph.ts
  - src/extensions/node/blockquote.ts

src/doc/change.ts and src/extensions/functionality/undo-redo.ts descend from
Wordgard's implementations of ChangeSet and history, which themselves originate
in CodeMirror 6 (https://codemirror.net/), by the same author.

